# 02_figures_and_supp_tables.R
# Senior thesis / field course manuscript outputs
#
# Purpose:
#   Generates all main-text figures, supplementary figures, and supplementary tables
#   for the manuscript entitled:
#   "Pathways and predictors of independent research at a higher education institution"
#
# Inputs:
#   Requires objects generated by 01_analysis.R, which are loaded from:
#     outputs/objects/*.rds
#
# Outputs:
#   Main-text figures:
#     Figure 1 – Field course participation
#     Figure 2 – Course-level predictors of thesis completion
#     Figure 4 – Timing analyses, Course-specific probability curves
#
#   Supplementary figures:
#     Demographic participation gaps
#     Temporal trends in participation gaps
#     Permutation test supplementary figure for advisor-student matching
#
#   Supplementary tables:
#     S1 – Thesis participation by major
#     S2 – Course-specific effects on thesis completion
#     S3 – Descriptive statistics
#     S4 – Correlation Matrix
#     S5 – Power analysis
#     S6 – Course-specific timing models
#     S7 – Demographic representation
#
# Expected project structure:
#   outputs/objects/
#   drafts/Figures/
#   drafts/Tables/
#
# Notes:
#   This script contains only manuscript outputs and formatting.
#   All data cleaning, model fitting, and object creation are performed in
#   01_analysis.R.


